</section>

<!-- WORK GALLERY -->
<section class="gallery" id="work">
  <div class="container gallery-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Inside the shop</span>
    <h2 class="h2">A look at the work.</h2>
    <p class="lead">From routine oil services to full engine builds — a glimpse at what rolls through our bays every week.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="gwrap">
    <img src="/assets/bmw-x5-service.jpeg" alt="BMW X5 with the hood up for service in the shop bay" loading="lazy" width="600" height="300">
    <img src="/assets/bmw-engine-bay-service.jpeg" alt="Clean BMW engine bay during diagnostics" loading="lazy" width="600" height="300">
    <img src="/assets/bmw-coupe-on-lift.jpeg" alt="White BMW coupe raised on the shop lift" loading="lazy" width="600" height="300">
    <img src="/assets/bmw-intake-detail.jpeg" alt="BMW intake manifold removed with tools laid out for detailed engine work" loading="lazy" width="600" height="300">
    <img src="/assets/bmw-engine-diagnostics.jpeg" alt="BMW engine bay open on the shop floor during diagnostics" loading="lazy" width="600" height="300">
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY -->
<section class="sec why" id="why">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="why-copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why you can trust us</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin:16px 0 16px">Dealer-grade work, neighborhood care.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Searching for a German car specialist near you? We've built a dealership-level operation — the training, the tools, the parts — and run it with the honesty and speed only an independent foreign &amp; European car repair shop in San Antonio can offer.</p>
      <div class="why-list">
        <div class="wl"><div class="ico"><i data-lucide="award"></i></div><b>ASE &amp; Factory Trained</b><span>Master-certified on the exact platforms we service.</span></div>
        <div class="wl"><div class="ico"><i data-lucide="scan-line"></i></div><b>Dealer Equipment</b><span>The same diagnostic systems the franchises use.</span></div>
        <div class="wl"><div class="ico"><i data-lucide="package-check"></i></div><b>OEM &amp; Genuine Parts</b><span>Factory-quality parts, never the cheapest box.</span></div>
        <div class="wl"><div class="ico"><i data-lucide="car"></i></div><b>Loaners &amp; Shuttle</b><span>Stay on schedule while we handle the work.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-vis reveal"><img src="/assets/technician-at-work.jpeg" alt="Technician in gloves working on the front end of a BMW" loading="lazy" width="600" height="480"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BOOKING -->
<section class="sec book" id="book">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="book-shell" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto">
      <div class="book-copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Book · Estimate · Ask</span>
        <h2 class="h2" data-make-tpl="Let's get your {make} taken care of." style="text-align:center">Ready to skip the dealer?</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:16px auto 30px;max-width:54ch">Book a service, ask for an estimate, or just send a question — one quick form, answered the same business day by a real technician at the shop.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content:center">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/appointments"><i data-lucide="calendar-check"></i>Book / Contact</a>
          <a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+12103991172"><i data-lucide="phone"></i>(210) 399-1172</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>`;
